    "fields": {
      "Name": "Chief of Staff",
      "CategoryID": "@lookup:MJ: AI Agent Categories.Name=Assistant",
      "Description": "Personal, always-on Chief of Staff agent (one per user) that coordinates across organizational workstreams, tracks quarterly priorities and OKRs (Tasks & TaskCheckIns), monitors blocking Issues, writes executive briefings, manages approvals under narrowed per-user policies (MJ: AI Agent User Policies), schedules its own wake cycles via the 3-Tier Wake Gate on MJ: User Routines, and follows up across chat, email, and voice/telephony.",
